Optional build-time features (not part of default builds or release
artifacts):

- The `voice` feature statically links sherpa-onnx
  (https://github.com/k2-fsa/sherpa-onnx, Apache License 2.0), which bundles
  kaldi-native-fbank, espeak-ng (GPL-3.0 with exceptions) and ONNX Runtime
  phonemization data. The GPL espeak-ng code is only reachable through the
  separately distributed `sherpa-onnx-offline-tts` binary (see below), never
  linked into this product's binary.
- The `llm` feature builds llama.cpp via the llama-cpp-2 crate
  (https://github.com/utilityai/llama-cpp-rs, MIT OR Apache-2.0; llama.cpp
  itself is MIT licensed).

Optional deployment assets (downloaded per models/README.md, never
